    <bpmn:process id="W_W1971" name="W1971. Government Account Revenue Recognition (PFRS 15)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Government contract with specific revenue recognition milestones
Frequency: Per government contract; monthly review
Volume: ~10–15 active government contracts
Owner: Accounting Manager
Participants: Accounting Manager, Trade Account Manager, CFO, External Auditor
Source: workflow W1971 — Government Account Revenue Recognition (PFRS 15)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1971_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1971_Lane1" name="Accounting Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1971_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1971_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1971_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1971_Lane2" name="External Auditor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1971_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1971_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1971_Start4" name="Government contract with specific revenue recognition milestones">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1971_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1971_Task5" name="Accounting Manager assesses government contract revenue recognition per PFRS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Accounting Manager assesses government contract revenue recognition per PFRS 15: (a) identify performance obligations: delivery of goods, installation services (if included), warranty, (b) transaction price: contract value less EWT, (c) allocation: allocate transaction price to each performance obligation, (d) timing: recognize revenue when (or as) performance obligation satisfied — for goods: at delivery and acceptance
Responsible (R): Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1971_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1971_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1971_Task6" name="Multi-delivery contracts: (a) revenue recognized per delivery milestone as each…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Multi-delivery contracts: (a) revenue recognized per delivery milestone as each delivery is accepted by government entity, (b) partial delivery: recognize revenue for accepted portion only, (c) installation included: separate performance obligation; recognize installation revenue when installation complete
Responsible (R): Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per milestone</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1971_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1971_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1971_Task7" name="Annual: External Auditor reviews government revenue recognition: (a) sample…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Annual: External Auditor reviews government revenue recognition: (a) sample government contracts for PFRS 15 compliance, (b) verify timing of revenue recognition (delivery acceptance vs. invoice date), (c) verify EWT treatment (net of EWT as transaction price)
Responsible (R): External Auditor
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per annual audit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1971_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1971_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1971_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1971_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-381 (ensure controlled execution — Government Billing, Collection &amp; Compliance (PA-46.3).) | - operational: Accounting Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1971_Assoc10" sourceRef="W1971_Annotation9" targetRef="W1971_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
